Patched copy of sp1-core-executor-runner 6.8.1 (crates.io), used via
[patch.crates-io] in ../../Cargo.toml. Only build.rs PATH 2 is changed: the
embedded helper binary sp1-core-executor-runner-binary is resolved and built
from the candidate workspace (`--manifest-path $NEARPROOF_HOST_MANIFEST -p
sp1-core-executor-runner-binary --locked --offline`) instead of as a standalone
package with its own crates.io Cargo.lock, so the offline vendored build works
and uses exactly the versions pinned in dependency-locks/Cargo.lock.
The published Cargo.lock / checksum files were removed; src/ is unchanged.
